   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# regions + diffusion: a prompt per region\n\n1. The **sample facade** node draws a facade and its mask folder, so this runs without files. Your own facade: a Load Image node for the matrix and the path of your mask folder in `mask_folder`.\n2. The regions node reads the mask folder: one region per mask (rules for names the folder does not have match nothing).\n3. Region Plan: edit the rules (prompts per group / name / tag). `{a|b}` picks one per region from the seed.\n4. Klein 9B paints every region except the floor 1 windows (`only = !W_F1_*`), ~10 s each.\n5. Qwen 2.1 + Viggle turbo LoRA puts a scene into each floor 1 window (frame in frame), ~25 s each.\n6. Seam Pass blends the borders of everything that changed; the result is saved to output/KubaRegions.\n\nIterate on a few regions: set `only` on a sampler (e.g. `W_F2_*`), mute the other sampler.\nKeep the Qwen cache on gpu / default; auto and int8 can crash on a 12 GB card.\n"
   ],
   "title": "Read me"
  },
